      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "In the end, seeing that the problem was not solved even in the latest version of VRChat I made attempts to see if I could solve the problem. Essentially most of the local functions were done with an onEnterTrigger, and I set it with the layers Player and PlayerLocal, because in previous versions, if I'm not mistaken, it didn't work well if I didn't put both layers. By simply removing the Player layer the problem has been solved, so the problem was not a bug, simply an update of the layers I was not aware of",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
