  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-06-04T17:39:36.646Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Yesterday I wrote about this problem on Discord, but I see that no one has created any posts about it, so to have more chances that it is seen by developers I write it here too. I'm creating a world where I have a lot of function inside, so I've often used VRC_Trigger in Local. Until last month everything worked correctly until the 2018.1.2 update arrived; said in simple terms, what should only be seen locally is seen by everyone.\n\nNow some clarifications: the last time I uploaded the world was yesterday and I used the new SDK, and was the only change I made, while the update before this dates back to a few days before the release of the 2018.1.2. It does not happen only to a single object but to all those set up locally and I confirm that before that update everything was fully functional. Talking to another user, he said that apparently the problem occurs with old worlds, but with new ones the problem does not appear",
